      "sourceTextSha256": "35105f6797fef27978e86f4a847306950b8264d7f2f98461a1ea46d13834ef73",
      "text": "Day 9 · A full-day tour of Recife and Olinda. Discover the three historic districts of the centre, Recife, Santo Antônio and Boa Vista: the Maurício de Nassau Bridge, the Praça da República, surrounded by the Governor’s Palace, the Santa Isabel Theatre and the Palace of Justice, and the Casa da Cultura, a 19th-century former prison that is now a centre of regional culture with craft and food shops. Then on to Olinda, a UNESCO World Heritage Site, with the Church of Mercy, the São Bento Monastery and the Cathedral of the Sé on the Alto da Sé hill, with a breathtaking view over the sister cities.",
